# Cloudflare-only Phase 1. No Supabase account or API key is required.
# Run npm run setup:local to generate .dev.vars with a random development secret.
# Production secret: npx wrangler secret put BETTER_AUTH_SECRET
# Set production APP_URL in wrangler.jsonc to the deployed HTTPS origin.
# Web Push (no paid provider): node scripts/setup-push.mjs local
# Production VAPID secret: node scripts/setup-push.mjs remote
# Existing keys are preserved. Never paste PUSH_VAPID_JWK into chat or NEXT_PUBLIC_*.
